Chapter: GopZones
  cites Works chapter GopLocale

Section: The Row

  ZoneRow = record {
    zr-name : Text,
    zr-city : Text,
    zr-base : Integer,
    zr-stripe : Integer
  }

  zrow : Text, Text, Integer, Integer -> ZoneRow
  zrow (n) (c) (b) (s) = ZoneRow { zr-name = n, zr-city = c, zr-base = b, zr-stripe = s }

Section: The Table

